- identical Redmine requests still in flight share one network call
- sidebar counts (limit=1) reuse a status list that is already loaded or loading
- the project list is requested once, however many views ask for it
- .btn-add.hidden had no CSS rule, so the Add button showed on every page
- client login checks skip while the tab is in the background

